# Upstream sources are committed complete: override the repository-wide ignore patterns
# (build/, *.obj, *.dll, ...) that would otherwise drop files the build needs.
!*
!*/
# ...but never Envelock keys, identities or passwords (also refused by scripts/check_release.py).
*.enc.json
owner*.json
recipient*.json
installation*.json
identity*.bin
generated_keys.h
audit_keys.h
*password*.txt
